      "id": "claim_06a0904d04324924b5ab23d2b3ddd3f3",
      "statement": "InterviewState v1 is `{ turns: readonly Turn[] }` — a list from the start because M8 grows the interview to many turns and a pair would force a schema break on the second — and Turn is a union tagged by `status` rather than by the presence of `answer`, because the tag is the only form TypeScript narrows on after a JSON round trip.",
