    {
      "id": "claim_aaa879bd5eb34b95a92cb24b0571908a",
      "statement": "The turn timestamps askedAt and answeredAt are ISO 8601 strings, never Date, because the session store returns everything under `state` exactly as JSON.parse produced it; AnsweredTurn carries the answering instant beside the answer so an answer with no time cannot be represented.",
