    {
      "id": "claim_41669f043f5645ddb9e3bd8ff02cfa5f",
      "statement": "createSingleTurnInterview binds CoreDependencies once and returns three operations — begin (leaves an existing session untouched), openingQuestion (yields the question's chunks or resolves undefined for a never-begun id), recordAnswer (answers recorded/no-session/no-open-question) — and no status code appears in the domain.",
