    {
      "id": "claim_7c91ababe27c4ed3aca1b6eaf681cb73",
      "statement": "openingQuestion resolving loads the session and decides existence (so a caller can refuse with 404 before opening a stream and nothing is inferred), while the generator's first pull is what reaches the model; a session already holding a turn replays the stored question via replayStoredQuestion and reaches no model, leaving askedAt untouched.",
