    {
      "id": "claim_a4e2998212584cc6855d4bbd03410a7b",
      "statement": "leave() advances the production once more and also calls iterator.return?.(): advance() coalesces via `pending ??= pullChunk()` so it only serves a stream that reads its signal between chunks, while iterator.return covers a stream that never reads the signal whose finally would otherwise never run.",
      "evidence": [
